# Battery monitoring and power
#
# 6S Li-ion pack. Most thresholds came from Mission Planner "Initial Tune" (6S
# Li-ion selected). See ardupilot.md "Battery monitoring" and flight-platform.md.
#
# 21 = INA2XX: the Holybro PM02D (INA228), inline on the pack lead, read over I2C. It is
#   the source for pack voltage, current and consumed mAh, and so for every battery
#   failsafe below.  provenance: 2026-11-07
BATT_MONITOR,21
# ArduPilot I2C bus 1 = the FC's I2C1 pads (DA1/CL1): the hwdef's I2C_ORDER is I2C2 I2C1, so
#   bus 0 is I2C2, which carries the internal baro. The PM02D is on I2C1 with the other
#   battery-powered devices (docs/rekon10/fc-breakout.md, "I2C split").  provenance: 2026-11-28
BATT_I2C_BUS,1
# Full scale of the INA228 current reading: the driver sets the chip's current LSB from this
#   (AP_BattMonitor_INA2xx.cpp, current_LSB = max_amps / 2^19), so currents above it do not
#   fit. 164 A is the PM02D's stated maximum current sensing (PX4 PM02D page).
#   provenance: 2026-11-14
BATT_MAX_AMPS,164
BATT_CAPACITY,8000
#
# 4 = analog voltage and current: the FC's own VBAT and CURR inputs (PC0 = pin 10, PC1 =
#   pin 11 in the TBS_LUCID_H7 hwdef), fed by the ESC's voltage divider and current shunt.
#   Logged as BAT instance 1 beside the PM02D's instance 0, so the two read the same flight.
#   BATT2_FS_LOW_ACT and BATT2_FS_CRT_ACT default to 0 (no action), and MOT_BAT_IDX stays 0.
#   The multiplier and A/V are the hwdef defaults, uncalibrated for this ESC.
#   provenance: 2026-11-28
BATT2_MONITOR,4
BATT2_VOLT_PIN,10
BATT2_CURR_PIN,11
BATT2_VOLT_MULT,11
BATT2_AMP_PERVLT,40
# 0 = no low-voltage threshold. The Copter default is 10.5 V, and every monitor's
#   low-voltage state is a pre-arm check whatever its action, so an uncalibrated reading
#   under 10.5 V would block arming.  provenance: 2026-11-28
BATT2_LOW_VOLT,0
#
# Voltage thresholds (~3.20 / 3.10 / 3.00 V per cell on 6S). BATT_CRT_VOLT=18 is
#   toward the low end for sustained load -- raise slightly if it Lands early under
#   sag.  [ardupilot.md]
BATT_ARM_VOLT,19.2
BATT_LOW_VOLT,18.6
BATT_CRT_VOLT,18
BATT_LOW_MAH,0
BATT_CRT_MAH,250
BATT_LOW_TIMER,0
#
# Failsafe ACTIONS: 2 = RTL on both low and critical.  provenance: 2026-11-07
BATT_FS_LOW_ACT,2
BATT_FS_CRT_ACT,2
#
# Sag compensation: scale thrust between these pack voltages.  provenance: ac57658 2026-04-25
MOT_BAT_VOLT_MAX,24.6
MOT_BAT_VOLT_MIN,16.8
